<title>POLAND: WBK FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 10.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 10.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 10.90 vs   13.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   16.25 vs   17.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 34.76 vs   32.80</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	67.69 vs   61.05</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 23.05 vs   24.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   35.78 vs   36.67</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 72.98 vs   68.29</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     143.25 vs  125.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
